WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:06.446
<v Ishita>Our classroom is getting new tiles. How much floor is there?

00:00:06.446 --> 00:00:11.142
<v Rohan>Easy! Ten metres and eight metres... I'll add all the sides: thirty-six!

00:00:11.142 --> 00:00:13.908
<v Mishu>That's the perimeter, the distance round the edge.

00:00:13.808 --> 00:00:17.341
<v Mishu>Area is the surface inside: length times breadth.

00:00:17.241 --> 00:00:20.365
<v Mishu>Ten times eight is eighty square metres.

00:00:20.365 --> 00:00:22.930
<v Ishita>And a leaf? It has no straight sides!

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:24.390
<v Mishu>Trace it on graph paper.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:27.814
<v Mishu>Count the full squares, and the ones more than half inside.

00:00:27.814 --> 00:00:29.511
<v Rohan>And a whole rice field?

00:00:29.511 --> 00:00:32.600
<v Mishu>Hectares: a hundred metres by a hundred metres.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:39.906
<v Mishu>And remember: one square metre is ten thousand square centimetres, because it's a hundred times a hundred!
